{"title":"Young Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 62 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 6,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1.4\n        }</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ember-gland\">Ember Gland</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>15</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>522</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>603</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>348</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>95</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>15</td><td>in the wilds around 2050, 478</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>522</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>603</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>348</td><td>in the wilds around 2208, 460</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>95</td><td>in the wilds around 2063, 353</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"young-red-dragon\" data-map-level=\"56\">Show level 56 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 14 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-